  "details": "With the new avatar market place update you can no longer organize avatars, I used to be able to organize them by unfavorting and favoriting them again by sorted them by date added, which had the most recent avatar you favorite at the top, but now sorting them through date added, sortes them by the date they were uploaded to VRChat. I really Hope VRChat fixes this or make a new update that allows people to organize their favorite avatars by the way they want.",
